---
description: Drops a record that holds no value at any depth.
args:
  positional:
    - name: record
      description: The record to drop when it holds no values.
      type: field
---
// Mappers move the fields that they map, which can leave records such as
// `http: {}` behind, or records whose fields are all null. Callers drop nested
// records first, so that their parents can become empty.
if $record.flatten().values().where(x => x != null).is_empty() {
  drop $record
}
